        "created_at": "2013-05-06T03:05:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was playing Unity and I had two Bee Bots out when on the enviroment turn Judgement of Anubis was played and brought out of Anubis.&nbsp; During the End of the Environment Turn, the Shamise mummy destoryed one of the Bee Bots.&nbsp; I destoryed Anubis with the Bee Bot's destruction effect.&nbsp; Does this prevent the Judgement of Anubis end of turn effect since it says Anubis deals every target 2 damage and destorys Judgement of Anubis?</p><p>It was resolved it as if Anubis was in play for expediency's sake but I think without the source (Anubis) the end of turn effect would not happen.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:17.267Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
